#22500
credits room~
This area is my first in to RavenMUD, and i hope it will be well enjoyed.
This area is a small dedication to my dear doggy, Jay, who resently passed away
may he rest in peace and keep the gods as happy as he kept me.
This area was by :  Vultokar
~
