#22501
The Portal Room~
You've come to an odd island. The island is only 10 feet in diameter.
You are standing in an odd clearing, Ashe and snow spill out of the
portal to the north. Seems an deviant Wizard has creating a portal to
a land beyond comprehension. The land here is completely bare of life.
A small pile of very large bones stick out of the ashe near the portal.
~
