parchment wall~
The parchment says :

        Those who are foolish enough to enter my portals of time risk all !!!!
        The only way to get back to your correct time is to find the portal out,
        Beware !!! the portals are guarded by the most powerful creatures of that time
        and a unprepared adventurer may find himself lost in a time far away from home, 
        or dead !!! To die before your own birth or parish after your greatest most
distant 
        relative is not a honorable way to die.  You were warned !

~
